        "better-layout",
        "better-typography",
        "better-accessibility",
        "better-ui",
        "animate",
        "apple-design"
      ],
      "decision": "Mobile Web is a conditional reference, not a Craft mode. Existing methods own type, accessibility, layout, UI and motion. Platform fixes preserve selectable text, native activation and useful browser behavior; keyboard clearance requires browser-specific evidence rather than a dvh guarantee."
