      ],
      "decision": "States is an explicitly requested workbench, not automatic setup for ordinary refinement or a review. Preserve the real component and its production styling; isolate fixture reads, refreshes and mutations and use separate inspection chrome. Setup hands over before visual edits; cleanup requires the user’s request."
    }
